//  - The selected tab is marked three ways, so colour is never the only cue: an accent wash (accentSoft), accent text,
//    and a 3 px accent bar along its foot. The kit has one weight per size, so there is no bold to add.
//  - An enabled tab that is not selected is plain text. A disabled one is muted text, and a tap on it does nothing.
//    Disabled tabs are for a view that does not exist right now (a Camera the printer lacks); the screen says why
//    elsewhere, and the tab is not hidden, so the strip keeps the same places.
