//  - A tap on the selected tab reports it again (hit returns its index), so the screen can ignore or refresh.
//  - `bg` must be what the strip is drawn on: UI_COLOR_BG, UI_COLOR_SURFACE or UI_COLOR_SURFACE_2, the three
